["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">理解；领会；明白；变得清楚；被了解；被发现；被意识到；被发觉；讲得通；我明白了；我也这么想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196088\">ボブがいつ<ruby>来日<rp>(</rp><rt>らいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したか<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不知道博布什么时候来了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">忘れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わすれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">遗忘；忘记；忘却；遗漏</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124723\"><ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのを<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてごめんなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">对不起,忘了打电话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">私</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わたくし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">我；本人；个人的；私人的；自私；偏私；保密；机密</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159334\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたくし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>泳<rp>(</rp><rt>およ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能游泳。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n5:v:私\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">私</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わたし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">我</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我是学生。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渡す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わたす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摆渡过河；载运过河；架设；搭建；跨越；交付；交出；递交；传递；转移</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191763\">わたしを<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のむこうに<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">求你把我送到河边。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渡る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わたる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">渡过；跨越；穿过；延伸；覆盖；跨越；贯穿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190628\"><ruby>一行<rp>(</rp><rt>いっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はアメリカへ<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一行走过了美国。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏；不好；令人不满的；质量差；低劣；不足；邪恶；有罪；丑陋；不美观；有过错；应受责备；理亏；不擅长；做得不好；无利可图；无益；对不起；我的不好；不可原谅</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74724\">これは<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではないでしょう？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这不是一个糟糕的故事,对吗?</span></div></li>"]